        "AbstractText": "Emerging research in neuroscience is bridging the gap between mind and body. Thought is brain based and influences brain function. The continuum and bidirectionality of mind and body, thought and brain, emotions and physiology forms the basis of understanding neuropathic pain, a neuropsychiatric condition with myriad clinical manifestations."
